===== 2026-08-14 task-wal root-cause audit =====

Scope
-----
- Read-only audit of Nebula Graph 3.6 source and existing task-wal artifacts.
- No product source was changed.
- No Nebula service was started or stopped during this audit.
- Process check at final-review time found no nebula-storaged, nebula-metad, or nebula-graphd process.
- The requested task is root-cause analysis only; no fix was implemented.

