Audit outcome
-------------
Common upstream trigger:
  periodic empty NORMAL Raft logs from RaftPart::sendHeartbeat

Multi-day RSS drop trigger:
  repeated per-partition commit-key versions fill each space's RocksDB memtable,
  followed by Write Buffer Full flush

Long-term additive growth:
  per-partition AtomicLogBuffer Node growth before its logical capacity is reached
